id=asim
name=ASIM — SIM VoWiFi Proxy Router
author=asim
version=v0.1.0
description=Route the selected SIM's system VoWiFi (ePDG IKE/ESP) traffic through a root mihomo tunnel to a chosen proxy node, keep the SIM powered for AKA, and prevent it from camping on any domestic network. Non-intrusive: all other traffic untouched.
